        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "ASEETA gayghoadaw fuga Israeli ghawooda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ak ang'iing'i ea siida ramoorsiina giijeega Israeli, nea giyeeshi, Ea giijeega Israeli, ooleeysiiniit ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, aba gideaba weajoocheanda nibaloola badahuukeagwa, nea gwayi ‘agooga noowooschi fuga nyaawa jea goombal.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ramoorsiina nea giyeeshi, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, asaha aba gideaba, aba gideaba ninung' ahuwa raghoonyeanda, nea geenukghutaneegwa aba meadajeega sean. Nea ghoahuuyi soomjooga eemoojiga, ak goowooschi fuga sibaloola badahuuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba badaydeaba nih asi giijeega Israeli, ooleeysiiniit ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA gwayeesha giijeesu ea heayeeniga ea ghealooniga beega, ea moangoachihajeega ea heeda nyaraat ea ghoah raghoonyeanda, ea mujiinajeega ghayi nung'usa heeda buuneeda, was gea ghayi sigeanda, ghayi fool easanga eemoojiga ramagu gwanda meadajeega sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, aba huumwa aba beasta lachng'eanyiideanyu, neargu iita easanga eemoojiga, ea iita Edomesean saawa gageanda ng'eanyiideanyu ghoah dea nyaawa, aba hooseaneega gurooruunatka nyaawa sean. Ea hang'ooynata gurooruunatka nyaawa ak geejaksa jarooda ghoah shageata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iiramoorsi ng'eanyiida Israeli giyeeshi giijeega ea heayeeniga, ea ghealooniga beega ea moangoachihajeega, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. Ng'ula, neabalooli aba lachng'eanyiideanyu ea nyarasteanyu, aba gideaba noogeandi baspaseega eemoojiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, neagatkachi geatindeanyu nea geayeenyi aba huumwa eemoojiga neekeeweegwa mida meadajeega sean, saawa gayghwaat baspaseega nyaawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Nea agooga, ea giijeega Israeli gajooruuni damealgeagwa ak ghoatawji fugeasu was Israeli haghweegeagwa, aba gideaba saawa niriikghta gabiikta gealga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba ng'ula, aniini ghaamiinaadi aba meatkweedeang'wa, ak gaydeafurseegwa geaw ak gajeebwareagwa nea geehista histeayda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak aniini gaydanung' ghoahaada buuneeda was fuga sean bea Israeli, asaha, sean earada. Ak mujiinajeega gaygoobiida buuneeda nea heeda nyaraat gajeadeas. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydeaheaneegwa buuneeda ea dugwa, ak gayghoahaada muuchi nea gwaji ak gaydanung' goobiida buuneeda jeedeang'wa aba gidaghayi oowuurjeewi bea mwadi. Ak gaydasineegwa gea miyaasiin ng'al gea miyaasiin ghayi bea giing'eeteang'wa ak gajanala gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asaha gaydeadu buuneeda gaweelweela badahuukeagwa, asaha fugeasu was Israeli, ak saawa gaygoombalnyi. Ak gayhuuwa hearaniischooda nyaawa ak gidang'eada ghamneawa maynung' gameewa diibiga nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, aba gideaba gwayeeniiseey buuneeda, ‘Ang'iing'i ng'eanyiida giyeagay buuneeda, nea ang'iing'i ea ninung' goosha fuga eemeadaang'u,’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "asi maygudu biikta aga buuneeda gicha nea maygudu biikta nung' goosha fuga eemeadaang'u gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea maygudu dabiikta damwas goong'eaweegwa eemoojiga, nea gafooleegwa, nea majanung' goodiiy eemeedeang'wa, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Giibinda eesh bea fuga Israeli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobaloolan ng'asheanda NG'UTAMIIDA nea gwayi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ea orjeeda siida, Israeli damanda mideewa ng'eanyiida nyaawa nea gabwa geat, ghang'uda riing'eeda aba naweadinga nyaawa ea sinaweega nyaawa. Naweadinga nyaawa aba madeedeanyu gawuurji ririnnyeanda gatmooda neaweesa eaghwada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi geanyareeksi saawa, aba badayda foojeanda ahiida aba badayda ng'eanyiida, ea gideaba ghang'uda ririnnyeanda aba sanaamajeega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaadaardi saawa aba jeeda eemoojiga, ak ghwadarda aba jeeda darooraka sean, aba giteena naweadinga nyaawa nea geargweaksi aba giteena sinaweega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak damanda madeeda jeedeaba eemeedida, ghayi weesean, hean geang'uda ririnnyeanda gheawungeasu ghaydit. Ak gabaloola buuneeda saawa nea gwayi, ‘suh fuga NG'UTAMIIDA gil ak gwaleabu ng'eanyiidaanyi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghaabwaydi saawa aba gheawungeasu ghaydit ghayi ng'uda fuga Israeli ririnnyeanda aba jeeda eemoojiga ghayi weesa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Asi eeshiina fuga Israeli, gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, measini ng'asheanji aba badaydeang'wa, Ea fuga Israeli, geasinyi aba badayda gheawungeasu ghaydit ghayi oang'udi ririnnyeanda aba jeeda eemoojiga ghayi ooweesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydaamiidu gheawungeasu haw, ghayi sing'uda ririnnyeanda aba jeeda eemoojiga, ghayi oang'udi ririnnyeanda aba jeenyaawa. Ak eemoojiga gayghwanal gideaba geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, ii sinung' daamiidu aba jeedeang'wa aba madeedeang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gaydearuuna jeeda eemoojiga ak gaydabwada geat ak gearuuni jeeda darooraka sean ak geadeelsi jeeda ng'eanyiideang'wa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydeadalealseegwa beega miyaas, ak abeeda gajamiyeasiita, gaydaamiyaasiideagwa aba ririnyeandeang'wa sean ea aba sanaamajeegeagwa sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gaydagooneegwa guroorooda miy nea ghaayiinyi guroorooda miy jeedeang'wa. Ak gaydageanda guroorooda hang'waayda lagheaneeda mida saseenuukeagwa ak gaydagooneegwa guroorooda masa ng'asheega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydayiin gurooroodeanyu jeedeang'wa, ak gaydanung' aweelweelana jeeda deaweedajeegeasu, ak gajoong'waanya hamurajeegeasu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak agooga gajoopiidana ng'eanyiita ghayi aadawji ghweanigeagwean, ak gajoowoosa fugeasu, nea aniini gaydoaw ASEETEANG'WA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaydaaghuuhaneegwa ririnyeandeang'wa sean ak gaydanung' ghwaheas boogeagwa nea ghoahaada, nea maygut adaaha geejeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gaydanung' ghoahaada haghweega geediga, ea booga madameega. Ak ea maygut goong'eaweegwa eemoojiga aba jalooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda gajoopkaada naweadingeagwa munyas, ea sinaweegeagwa munyas. Ak gajasta sasanuukeagwa aba gheanyangeagwa aba ng'asheegeagwa munyas oosinayi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anala gideaba measini ng'asheanji aba badahuukeagwa, gwarugu NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA. Abwaspwasa nea goohirbabanyi aba naweadingeagwa, Ea fuga Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, eaweedida inyas ghamiineegwa ea ng'asheegeagwa munyas. Abeeda gaydanung' goobiida buuneeda mujiinajeega, nea heeda nyaraat geadeas gicha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea ng'eanyiida was raghoonyeanda gajeabwar, aba gideaba siida ng'ata was sean may gwajeeng'u gideaba raghoonyeanda gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak saawa gaygwayi, ‘Ng'eanyiini ghayi was raghoonyeandean, ghamneawa nuwuurji boostaaneeda Edeni, nea mujiinajeega ghayi was eemeega ea raghoonyeanda ea eemeega ghamneawa gwandeawa hilgweanda, nea gwanda buuneeda jeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda eemoojiga was easanga neekeeweegwa aba meadajeega sean, gayghwanal gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA, naadeaschi heeda ghayi nyaraat. Ak ea neahisti histeayda ng'eanyiida ghayi was raghoonyeanda, ng'asheesu gearugu aniini NG'UTAMIIDA ak gaydasin’.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Gwayi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEETA, gaygamusan fuga Israeli danung' ghwasaang'ayiit saawa ea gwadeena hawanda gisilga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 36:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaygwadeena hawanda gisilga jea eatayda lukghumeeda, gwadeena hawanda Yerusalemu bea ghweelmeadaanyi aba gidaghayi sirukuteayda ea gichea ghoanyiita buuneeda mujiinajeegiga ghayi was raghoonyeandean ak gayghwanal gideaba aniini geawooschi NG'UTAMIIDA.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.36.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.36.38"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
